&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Zscaler (NASDAQ: ZS) accelerates digital transformation so customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. The Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange™️ platform protects thousands of customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location. Distributed across 160+ public exchanges globally and thousands of private exchanges at the edge, the SASE-based Zero Trust Exchange is the world’s largest in-line cloud security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of work is Human + AI and are building an AI-native enterprise where human potential is amplified by machine intelligence to solve the world’s hardest security challenges. Driven by deep customer obsession, we are committed to the mission, outcome, and to each other. We bring these commitments to life through three core behaviors: ownership and collaboration, trust through outcomes and impact, and a challenge culture with ongoing feedback. Ready to make an impact at the company pioneering security transformation in the AI era? Join us at Zscaler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are looking for a Manager - India Tax to join our team. This is a Hybrid role, reporting to the Senior Manager - Tax in the Tax department. In this role, you will drive direct tax compliance and transfer pricing operations for Indian entities, ensure precise TDS calculations and statutory return filings, and maintain rigorous tax reconciliations to support financial accuracy and regulatory integrity across the organization.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undertaking direct tax and transfer pricing compliances for Indian entities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparing TDS calculations and ensuring payments are made within due dates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparing and ensuring accurate, timely filing of direct tax returns, including TDS returns, APA filings, corporate tax returns, tax audits, and transfer pricing forms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparing monthly direct tax reconciliations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act like an owner. You take complete accountability for direct tax operations and transfer pricing outcomes, balancing technical strategy with hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You operate with urgency. You thrive in fast-paced environments, managing statutory deadlines and complex tax filings with speed and precision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a problem-solver. You navigate evolving tax regulations and compliance requirements proactively to deliver accurate solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You champion simplicity. You bring clarity and structure to complex financial data, TDS calculations, and monthly reconciliations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You lead with integrity. You uphold the highest standards of accuracy and regulatory compliance, earning trust through consistent, transparent execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chartered Accountant credential with 8-10 years of experience in direct tax compliances and tax returns within a multinational organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of tax accounting, direct tax compliances, and transfer pricing frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to function effectively in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a proven ability to leverage AI technologies and workflows to drive measurable operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated proactiveness in project execution and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional eye for detail across complex tax data and reconciliations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;#LI-HG1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zscaler.com/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. We strive to create a workplace where employees are treated with respect and have the chance to succeed. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy or related medical conditions), age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. &lt;em&gt;See more information by clicking on the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights: Workplace Discrimination is Illegal &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;link.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
